OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,FAreas of important heathland and rare
OL,7,Fgrassland on the Isle of Wight are
OL,8,F"likely to take years to recover"
OL,9,Ffollowing a major wildfire.
OL,11,FThe National Trust said the fire at
OL,12,FHeadon Warren, which damaged around
OL,13,Fnine hectares, as a stark reminder of
OL,14,Fthe impact wildfires can have.
OL,16,FThe blaze, which broke out on Thursday
OL,17,F23 July, required a four-day multi-
OL,18,Fagency response, involving up to 80
OL,19,Ffirefighters at its peak.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
