FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,FLocal crews from Hampshire & Isle of
OL,7,FWight Fire and Rescue Service were
OL,8,Fsupported by firefighters from the
OL,9,Fmainland.
OL,11,FA helicopter was deployed by the
OL,12,FNational Trust, funded through its
OL,13,Finsurance fund, to carry out targeted
OL,14,Fwater drops on inaccessible hotspots.
OL,16,FThe fire is thought to have been
OL,17,Fcaused by a small campfire.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
