OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,FStaff from the National Trust said
OL,7,Fthey expect areas of Headon Warren to
OL,8,Ftake years to return to its original
OL,9,Fstate.
OL,11,FThe area is home to some of the
OL,12,Fisland's rarest habitats, including
OL,13,FDartford warblers, nightjars,
OL,14,Fwhitethroats, stonechats and rare
OL,15,Finvertebrates including beetles and
OL,16,Fthe beewolf wasp.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
