OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,FPaul Davies, Countryside Manager,
OL,7,FNational Trust, Isle of Wight, said:
OL,8,F"We're incredibly grateful to
OL,9,FHampshire & Isle of Wight Fire and
OL,10,FRescue Service, the helicopter crew,
OL,11,Fall fire crews and support teams, and
OL,12,Fthe many partners who helped tackle
OL,13,Fthe fire, including our tenants at
OL,14,FWarren Farm, neighbouring farmers,
OL,15,Flocal landowners, community
OL,16,Forganisations and partner agencies.
OL,18,F"Their combined efforts helped prevent
OL,19,Fthe fire from spreading further across
OL,20,FHeadon Warren during what was a
OL,21,Fchallenging and complex incident.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,F"While nature will recover, some areas
OL,7,Fare likely to take years to return to
OL,8,Ffull health, and inevitably it will
OL,9,Fimpact our long-term restoration
OL,10,Fefforts.
OL,12,F"This fire is a reminder that even a
OL,13,Fsmall spark can have an impact on
OL,14,Fwildlife and the landscapes we all
OL,15,Fcherish. By taking care when visiting
OL,16,Fthe countryside, we can all help
OL,17,Fprotect these special places for
OL,18,Fgenerations to come.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,FJames Osman at Warren Farm added: "It
OL,7,Fwas very upsetting to see the impact
OL,8,Fof the wildfire on this precious
OL,9,Fheathland habitat that we have been
OL,10,Fworking hard to protect over the past
OL,11,Ffew years.
OL,13,F"Through conservation grazing and land
OL,14,Fmanagement, we help manage around 30
OL,15,Fhectares of heathland and grassland
OL,16,Facross Headon Warren, creating the
OL,17,Fconditions needed for rare wildlife
OL,18,Fand plant life to thrive.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,F"Seeing the fire spread so quickly was
OL,7,Fshocking. It is a stark reminder of
OL,8,Fthe dangers that wildfires pose to the
OL,9,Fcountryside, especially during these
OL,10,Fprolonged dry conditions.
OL,12,F"Thankfully, there were no livestock
OL,13,Fon the site at the time, although
OL,14,Fanimals grazing in an adjacent field
OL,15,Fwere moved further away from the
OL,16,Fdanger zone as a precaution.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,F"With little rain forecast, the coming
OL,7,Fweeks will be a critical time for all
OL,8,Fof us to work together as a community
OL,9,Fto help prevent further fires and
OL,10,Fprotect these special landscapes."
OL,12,FIn addition to the wildfire at Headon
OL,13,FWarren, the Isle of Wight has had 13
OL,14,Flarge fires in the open so far this
OL,15,Fyear, this is more than the whole of
OL,16,F2025.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,FLarry Mackrell, Wildfire Support
OL,7,FOfficer at HIWFRS, said: "During
OL,8,Fperiods of hot, dry weather, even the
OL,9,Fsmallest spark can quickly spread,
OL,10,Fcausing fires that put people,
OL,11,Fwildlife, and the countryside at risk.
OL,13,F"The Headon Warren fire was
OL,14,Fparticularly challenging due to the
OL,15,Fterrain, its remote location and
OL,16,Fproximity to the cliff edge. Incidents
OL,17,Flike this require a significant
OL,18,Femergency response, which can take
OL,19,Ffirefighters away from other incidents
OL,20,Fwhere they may be needed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786000684
OL,3,CHeathland likely to take years to
OL,4,Crecover following major wildfire
OL,6,F"We are urging anyone visiting the
OL,7,Fcountryside to take extra care and
OL,8,Favoid lighting campfires or using
OL,9,Fbarbecues, as they can easily start
OL,10,Ffires. Please also dispose of
OL,11,Fcigarettes, litter, and other waste
OL,12,Fresponsibly."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
